@startuml

title Sequence Diagram: Взаимодействие Telegram Bot с Системой

actor Пользователь as User
participant "Telegram Bot" as Bot
participant "Серверная система" as Api

== Initial File Upload ==

User -> Bot : Отправка PDF файла в ТГ-бот
activate Bot

Bot -> Api : POST /api/v1/parse, отправка на сервер
activate Api

note over Bot, Api
**Headers:**
X-Bot-Token: <bot_token>
Content-Type: multipart/form-data
Content-Length: <file_size>
end note

Api -> Api : Валидация файла и токена
Api -> Api : Формирование JSON ответа

Api --> Bot : 202 Accepted
note left of Api
**Response Body:**
{
    "request_id": "req_12345",
    "status": "processing",
    "model_version": "<model_version>",
    "processing_time_ms": 30
}
end note
deactivate Api

Bot --> User : "Файл принят в обработку. Ожидайте результат..."

== Polling Phase ==

loop [every 5 seconds until completed/error]
    Bot -> Api : GET /api/v1/status/{request_id}
    activate Api
    note over Bot, Api
    **Headers:**
    X-Bot-Token: <bot_token>
    end note
    
    Api -> Api : Проверка статуса обработки
    
    alt Still processing
        Api --> Bot : 200 (processing)
        note left of Api
        **Response:**
        {
            "request_id": "req_12345",
            "status": "processing",
            "progress": 65
        }
        end note
        deactivate Api
        Bot --> User : "Обработка... 65%"
    
    else Processing completed
        Api --> Bot : 200 (completed)
        note left of Api
        **Response:**
        {
            "request_id": "req_12345",
            "status": "completed",
            "result": { ...JSON structure... }
        }
        end note
        deactivate Api
        
        Bot --> User : Отформатированный JSON (from 2xx/3xx mapping)
        break
    
    else Processing failed
        Api --> Bot : 200 (failed)
        note left of Api
        **Response:**
        {
            "request_id": "req_12345",
            "status": "failed",
            "error": "processing_error"
        }
        end note
        deactivate Api
        
        Bot --> User : Сообщение об ошибке (from 4xx mapping, e.g., "Не удалось распознать документ")
        break
    end
end

== Error Scenarios ==

alt Invalid file type
    User -> Bot : Send invalid file type
    activate Bot
    Bot -> Api : POST /api/v1/parse
    activate Api
    Api --> Bot : 400 Bad Request
    deactivate Api
    Bot --> User : "INVALID_FORMAT" (from 4xx mapping)
    deactivate Bot
else Large file
    User -> Bot : Send large file
    activate Bot
    Bot -> Api : POST /api/v1/parse
    activate Api
    Api --> Bot : 413 Payload Too Large
    deactivate Api
    Bot --> User : "FILE_TOO_LARGE" (from 4xx mapping)
    deactivate Bot
else Maintenance
    User -> Bot : Send PDF during maintenance
    activate Bot
    Bot -> Api : POST /api/v1/parse
    activate Api
    Api --> Bot : 503 Service Unavailable
    deactivate Api
    Bot --> User : "SERVICE_TEMPORARILY_UNAVAILABLE" (from 5xx mapping)
    deactivate Bot
end

@enduml